{
  "id": "r01-l01",
  "unit": "r01-signs",
  "title": "Way in, way out",
  "status": "draft",
  "tip": "Signs use **formal words** that you rarely say. You already know their everyday partners:\n\n- **প্রবেশ** 'way in' (you say ঢোকা)\n- **ফটক** 'gate' (you say গেট)\n- **বাহির** 'way out', the old written form of বাইরে\n\n**Reading the conjuncts:** a small stroke under a letter is **র-ফলা** (ro-fola), an r after it: **প্র** = প + র in **প্রবেশ**, **প্রধান**. A hook on top is **ref**, an r before it: **র্গ** in **বহির্গমন** (bohir-gomon). In **অভ্যর্থনা** the য-ফলা doubles the ভ: *obbhorthona*.",
  "vocab": [
    {
      "id": "probesh",
      "bn": "প্রবেশ",
      "tr": "probesh",
      "en": "entry; way in",
      "notes": "Register: formal (written). Everyday word: ঢোকা. Sign: প্রবেশ 'Way in'. প্র = প + র (ro-fola)."
    },
    {
      "id": "bahir",
      "bn": "বাহির",
      "tr": "bahir",
      "en": "way out (sign)",
      "notes": "Register: formal (written). Everyday word: বাইরে. Older, written form of বাইরে 'outside'; on signs it means 'Way out'."
    },
    {
      "id": "prosthan",
      "bn": "প্রস্থান",
      "tr": "prosthan",
      "en": "exit; departure",
      "notes": "Register: formal (written). Everyday word: বের হওয়া. প্র (ro-fola) + স্থ (স + থ)."
    },
    {
      "id": "bohirgomon",
      "bn": "বহির্গমন",
      "tr": "bohirgomon",
      "en": "exit (way out)",
      "notes": "Register: formal (written). Everyday word: বের হওয়ার পথ. Sign word, rare in speech: জরুরি বহির্গমন 'emergency exit'. র্গ = ref on গ."
    },
    {
      "id": "fotok",
      "bn": "ফটক",
      "tr": "fotok",
      "en": "gate",
      "notes": "Register: formal (written). Everyday word: গেট. প্রধান ফটক 'main gate'."
    },
    {
      "id": "prodhan",
      "bn": "প্রধান",
      "tr": "prodhan",
      "en": "main; chief",
      "notes": "Register: formal (written). Everyday word: বড়. প্রধান ফটক 'main gate', প্রধান শাখা 'main branch'."
    },
    {
      "id": "obbhorthona",
      "bn": "অভ্যর্থনা",
      "tr": "obbhorthona",
      "en": "reception",
      "notes": "Register: formal (written). ভ্য doubles the bh: o-bbhor-tho-na. Then র্থ (ref on থ)."
    },
    {
      "id": "bibhag",
      "bn": "বিভাগ",
      "tr": "bibhag",
      "en": "department",
      "notes": "Register: formal (written). জরুরি বিভাগ 'emergency department'. Also 'division' (of the country)."
    }
  ],
